## Phase 3: User Story 1 — See a supplier's addresses, contacts, bank accounts and agreements (Priority: P1) 🎯 MVP

**Goal**: A supplier opens on a full detail screen that shows its fields and four sections, read-only for users without Update. Row, Edit and New on the list go to the screen instead of the side panel.

**Independent test**: open a supplier that has links and agreements on the test tenant: every record appears in its section. A supplier with none shows four empty-state messages. A user without Suppliers Update sees no controls (spec US1).

