## Phase 5: User Story 3 — Record and maintain supplier agreements (Priority: P2)

**Goal**: On a saved supplier, a user with Update adds, edits and removes agreements. Each change takes effect at once. A new supplier stays open after its first save, so agreements can be added straight away.

**Independent test**: on a saved supplier, add an agreement, change its end date, try an end before the start (refused), then remove it. Reopen after each step: the section matches (spec US3).

- [X] T033 [US3] Add l10n keys to `lib/l10n/app_en.arb` and `lib/l10n/app_es.arb`, then run `flutter gen-l10n`: `addAgreementButton`, `newAgreementDialogTitle`, `editAgreementDialogTitle`, the start, end and notes field labels, `supplierAgreementEndBeforeStartError`, `deleteAgreementButton`, `deleteAgreementConfirmTitle`, `deleteAgreementConfirmMessage` (with the two dates), and the agreement save and delete failure texts.
